  "releaseNotes": "- Fixed backup state issue (null preservation for BlockPolygons and BlockLines) in the 2-pass relaxation algorithm.\n      - Added comprehensive XML documentation comments across all geometric types (GeoPoint, GeoLine, GeoPolygon, GeoRectangle, GeoVector, and Tolerance) to resolve compilation warning CS1591.\n      - Updated CAD and Tekla test runners to target x64 platform explicitly to prevent architecture mismatch warnings (MSB3270).\n      - Configured NuGet metadata with Copyright and PackageTags.\n      - Added package icon according to Microsoft best practices.",
